# The four stream unions and their branch components are
# php/codegen/generate.php's, not openapi-generator's (ADR 29.9.26u D2): its
# PHP `oneOf` model is the {event, data} wrapper and picks its branch from
# inside the decoded object. One glob per union covers the union and every
# `<Union><Event>` branch. The leading `**/` matches the root-relative
# src/Model/<file>, as for Ruby. generate.php refuses a model directory
# holding any of these names, so a fifth stream this file does not name
# fails codegen-php.
**/Model/GenerateVocabularyEvent*.php
**/Model/CreateLessonPlanEvent*.php
**/Model/StreamLessonPlanEvent*.php
**/Model/SendTutorMessageEvent*.php
